WEBVTT

01:33.380 --> 01:35.651
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.711 --> 01:38.011
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.080 --> 01:40.981
(Episode 39)

01:45.321 --> 01:47.190
Let me say something first.

01:48.190 --> 01:49.761
This is the first time...

01:49.830 --> 01:51.401
that Mr. Meng has come to our house for a meal.

01:52.360 --> 01:54.800
Let me toast to you on behalf of the whole family.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.830
Welcome.

01:56.671 --> 01:57.601
Thank you.

01:58.201 --> 01:59.000
Thank you.

02:07.681 --> 02:08.681
Actually, I'm here today...

02:09.481 --> 02:11.181
because I want...

02:11.981 --> 02:12.981
to discuss with you...

02:13.651 --> 02:14.681
about the kids' marriage.

02:15.821 --> 02:17.120
Song Yan...

02:17.191 --> 02:18.120
doesn't have his parents around.

02:18.191 --> 02:20.321
We treat him like our own.

02:20.821 --> 02:22.661
We should be the ones visiting you.

02:22.731 --> 02:23.560
Right?

02:23.631 --> 02:24.531
Yes.

02:24.590 --> 02:25.661
You're too kind.

02:26.201 --> 02:27.330
Actually, that's not important.

02:27.400 --> 02:28.800
What's important is that elders...

02:29.231 --> 02:30.001
and parents...

02:30.770 --> 02:32.041
want their children...

02:32.840 --> 02:33.571
to be happy.

02:34.400 --> 02:35.071
Yes.

02:36.441 --> 02:38.041
Marriage is between the two kids,

02:38.210 --> 02:39.840
but it's also a major event for the two families.

02:40.210 --> 02:40.941
Yes.

02:41.411 --> 02:42.180
How about this?

02:43.381 --> 02:44.680
I'll make a toast to all of you.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.580
From now on,

02:48.251 --> 02:49.390
I'll leave Qin Qin in your care.

02:51.321 --> 02:52.321
- Thank you. - All right.

02:52.390 --> 02:53.360
Here, cheers.

02:54.161 --> 02:54.960
Cheers.

02:59.860 --> 03:00.860
Don't worry.

03:01.131 --> 03:03.471
We surely won't let Qin Qin feel aggrieved.

03:03.870 --> 03:04.571
Yes.

03:04.631 --> 03:06.300
Xu Qin is great here.

03:06.441 --> 03:08.471
She is now the queen of our family.

03:08.840 --> 03:10.870
Don't interrupt when the adults are talking.

03:11.210 --> 03:12.080
I'm an adult too.

03:12.240 --> 03:13.240
Why can't I speak?

03:13.680 --> 03:15.881
I'm also speaking on behalf of our family.

03:15.951 --> 03:16.851
Right, Xu Qin?

03:17.080 --> 03:19.281
My daughter is too lively.

03:19.381 --> 03:20.381
Don't mind her, Mr. Meng.

03:20.451 --> 03:21.451
No.

03:22.351 --> 03:23.351
She's good.

03:25.821 --> 03:27.360
I heard that Wufang Street...

03:27.791 --> 03:28.531
will be demolished.

03:28.590 --> 03:29.430
- Right. - Yes.

03:30.590 --> 03:31.291
Then...

03:31.460 --> 03:33.001
where will you live after getting married?

03:33.060 --> 03:33.860
Don't worry about that.

03:33.930 --> 03:34.971
My brother has already...

03:37.671 --> 03:39.001
That won't be a problem.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.441
No matter where we move to,

03:40.601 --> 03:42.370
I'll surely help them prepare their house.

03:43.671 --> 03:44.441
Here, Mr. Meng.

03:44.511 --> 03:45.381
Let's make a toast together.

03:45.441 --> 03:46.411
To our children's happiness.

03:46.680 --> 03:47.340
- Here. - All right.

03:47.411 --> 03:48.110
- Let's make another toast. - Here.

03:48.180 --> 03:48.981
- To your happiness. - Here.

03:49.050 --> 03:50.150
- Happiness. - Yes.

04:09.270 --> 04:10.101
All right.

04:10.471 --> 04:11.430
You can just walk me here.

04:12.201 --> 04:12.900
Dad.

04:12.971 --> 04:14.270
I'll walk you to the end of the alley.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.240
It's okay.

04:17.240 --> 04:18.511
Let Song Yan walk me.

04:18.680 --> 04:20.281
I want to talk to him.

04:23.011 --> 04:23.881
Go in first.

04:27.180 --> 04:27.851
Go.

04:35.091 --> 04:36.091
Come on.

04:38.360 --> 04:39.031
Song Yan.

04:39.661 --> 04:41.000
I can tell.

04:41.570 --> 04:42.531
Qin Qin...

04:42.601 --> 04:44.101
is determined to marry you.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.041
I've also made up my mind...

04:46.200 --> 04:46.901
to marry her.

04:49.771 --> 04:50.810
Actually, before coming here,

04:51.610 --> 04:53.010
I was a little worried indeed.

04:54.081 --> 04:55.211
I was worried...

04:55.880 --> 04:57.450
that you wouldn't be able to make her happy.

04:59.581 --> 05:00.620
But to be honest,

05:00.680 --> 05:02.050
after coming here today,

05:02.820 --> 05:04.690
the atmosphere in your family...

05:05.820 --> 05:07.221
makes me so envious.

05:07.961 --> 05:09.791
It's something I never expected.

05:14.360 --> 05:15.031
Song Yan.

05:16.401 --> 05:17.601
I really hope...

05:18.200 --> 05:19.800
that your family in the future...

05:19.870 --> 05:21.471
can be this happy too.

05:23.010 --> 05:23.711
Don't worry.

05:24.310 --> 05:25.610
I definitely won't let her down.

05:27.440 --> 05:28.351
Back then,

05:28.711 --> 05:30.050
you couldn't get into military school...

05:30.651 --> 05:31.380
You don't have to mention...

05:31.921 --> 05:32.880
what happened in the past anymore.

05:33.581 --> 05:35.591
I don't regret any choice I made in the past.

05:36.091 --> 05:36.750
Besides,

05:37.391 --> 05:38.521
I'm doing very well now.

05:38.990 --> 05:40.591
I don't have any resentment or regrets.

05:41.161 --> 05:42.291
There are still a lot of possibilities for me in the future.

06:16.990 --> 06:17.961
What's the matter?

06:19.060 --> 06:20.430
We're going to rent a place.

06:20.831 --> 06:21.700
Do you feel...

06:21.771 --> 06:22.771
Stop.

06:23.070 --> 06:24.031
Don't be dramatic.

06:28.171 --> 06:29.110
However...

06:35.010 --> 06:36.880
Are you and Zhai Miao hiding something from me?

06:39.781 --> 06:40.750
What?

06:48.291 --> 06:49.231
We're really not hiding anything from you.

06:49.331 --> 06:50.091
What?

06:52.461 --> 06:53.831
Don't look at me like that.

06:54.401 --> 06:55.971
What did I do? Don't look at me.

06:57.171 --> 06:58.700
You're still playing dumb?

06:58.771 --> 06:59.440
Tell me.

06:59.500 --> 07:01.171
Are you keeping a lot of secrets from me?

07:04.310 --> 07:06.081
I really don't, honey.

07:08.010 --> 07:08.711
All right.

07:09.010 --> 07:09.880
Let's go to bed.

07:18.151 --> 07:18.961
We're here.

07:21.291 --> 07:22.190
The key is inside.

07:22.690 --> 07:23.490
The landlord said...

07:23.560 --> 07:24.731
you can take a look first.

07:24.961 --> 07:26.000
If you like it,

07:26.060 --> 07:27.331
he'll ask his wife.

07:28.531 --> 07:29.200
Okay.

07:32.940 --> 07:34.740
(I've waited for you for so long)

07:36.271 --> 07:37.740
The landlord is a romantic.

07:39.240 --> 07:40.810
It's no use praising him.

07:41.010 --> 07:42.581
Whether we can move in or not...

07:42.651 --> 07:44.481
depends on the landlord's wife.

07:44.880 --> 07:45.880
The wife is the owner.

07:49.950 --> 07:50.891
Let's go.

08:10.671 --> 08:11.641
The bathroom.

08:15.041 --> 08:15.711
Come.

08:16.050 --> 08:17.110
This is the kitchen.

08:17.180 --> 08:17.851
Let's check it later.

08:17.911 --> 08:19.081
Let's look at the study.

08:29.461 --> 08:30.260
What do you think?

08:30.990 --> 08:32.430
It's very cozy.

08:32.961 --> 08:33.630
You know what?

08:33.700 --> 08:34.760
I've looked at a lot of houses online,

08:34.831 --> 08:36.231
but I don't particularly like any of them.

08:36.430 --> 08:37.601
This is good.

08:38.430 --> 08:39.601
Let's look at the bedroom.

08:45.070 --> 08:47.141
This is our bedroom.

08:56.820 --> 08:58.151
Isn't this balcony very spacious?

08:58.590 --> 08:59.491
When the time comes,

08:59.560 --> 09:00.820
we can plant some plants here.

09:00.891 --> 09:02.261
Then we'll put our fish tank...

09:02.330 --> 09:03.861
and little turtles here.

09:04.930 --> 09:05.761
It's very suitable for that, isn't it?

09:06.501 --> 09:07.200
You know what?

09:07.261 --> 09:08.671
Although I've never met the landlord,

09:08.800 --> 09:10.600
I'm already in the palm of his hand.

09:10.671 --> 09:11.771
Let's rent this place.

09:12.241 --> 09:13.600
Don't make a decision yet.

09:14.171 --> 09:15.100
There's one more place...

09:15.271 --> 09:16.241
I haven't shown you.

09:16.440 --> 09:17.271
There's more?

09:19.241 --> 09:20.011
Let's go.

09:56.911 --> 09:57.680
This is so pretty.

09:57.751 --> 09:58.980
How did you find it?

09:59.980 --> 10:00.651
Do you like it?

10:00.850 --> 10:01.521
Yes.

10:01.580 --> 10:03.151
You must have spent a long time looking for it.

10:04.550 --> 10:05.921
Let me call the landlady.

10:06.190 --> 10:07.161
We need her permission.

10:07.361 --> 10:08.220
Hurry up and call her.

10:22.470 --> 10:23.541
You dialed the wrong number.

10:23.611 --> 10:24.741
This is my number.

10:24.871 --> 10:25.881
I am calling you,

10:26.411 --> 10:27.611
my landlady.

10:42.960 --> 10:43.631
Hello?

10:44.791 --> 10:45.730
Landlady.

10:46.531 --> 10:47.560
Your house is really nice.

10:48.060 --> 10:49.230
My wife likes it.

10:50.401 --> 10:51.271
Can we move in?

10:53.871 --> 10:54.641
Well,

10:55.041 --> 10:56.671
how long do you want to stay here?

11:00.281 --> 11:01.041
Forever.

11:02.810 --> 11:03.480
Is that okay with you?

11:10.491 --> 11:11.491
Yes.

11:13.521 --> 11:15.690
Song Yan, I love it here.

11:19.861 --> 11:20.531
Wait.

11:21.460 --> 11:22.930
There's one more thing I haven't done.

11:23.330 --> 11:24.070
What is it?

11:43.190 --> 11:43.850
Xu Qin.

11:45.491 --> 11:46.391
Thank you.

11:47.090 --> 11:48.830
Thank you for coming back to me.

11:49.491 --> 11:51.590
You've given me something to look forward to in the future.

11:53.060 --> 11:54.861
I'll protect you...

11:55.261 --> 11:56.330
just like how I'm protecting this city.

11:57.470 --> 11:59.300
I'm willing to give you everything I have.

12:00.300 --> 12:01.970
My mornings and dusks.

12:03.041 --> 12:05.111
My past and future.

12:05.480 --> 12:07.340
All my passion and preferences.

12:09.850 --> 12:10.980
I'll always be true.

12:11.680 --> 12:12.751
I'll always be faithful.

12:13.680 --> 12:14.751
I'll never betray you.

12:21.690 --> 12:22.430
Xu Qin.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.460
Please marry me.

12:32.501 --> 12:33.371
Okay.

13:20.521 --> 13:21.450
What's this?

13:21.751 --> 13:22.690
A ring?

13:22.891 --> 13:23.921
Are you getting married?

13:24.391 --> 13:25.521
Did you just notice?

13:25.690 --> 13:26.421
What kind of reaction is that?

13:26.491 --> 13:27.220
You're so slow.

13:27.291 --> 13:28.361
Let me see it.

13:30.631 --> 13:32.600
- Look at how big the diamond is. - Dong Dong.

13:33.060 --> 13:33.930
Put it back.

13:34.131 --> 13:35.631
Chief Song is so generous.

13:38.371 --> 13:39.241
Look at her.

13:39.300 --> 13:40.340
Since there's a happy event in her life,

13:40.401 --> 13:41.771
she has been smiling a lot these days.

13:43.440 --> 13:44.111
Let's go.

13:46.480 --> 13:47.411
What about you?

13:47.480 --> 13:48.611
What's up with your relationship?

13:48.680 --> 13:49.381
I...

13:49.450 --> 13:50.180
Busybody.

13:51.781 --> 13:52.651
What?

13:52.980 --> 13:54.251
Chief is getting married?

13:55.381 --> 13:56.491
His proposal was a success.

13:56.550 --> 13:57.220
Just wait.

13:57.291 --> 13:58.960
Something great is about to happen at the station.

13:59.320 --> 14:00.190
That won't do.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.021
Chief is doing something big in secret.

14:02.291 --> 14:03.661
Why didn't he ask us first?

14:03.730 --> 14:05.291
Is he getting married without permission from the station?

14:05.361 --> 14:06.261
That's right.

14:07.761 --> 14:08.761
You're so full of yourself.

14:09.001 --> 14:10.001
Do I need your permission...

14:10.401 --> 14:11.401
to get married?

14:11.570 --> 14:13.570
Chief, I'm congratulating you on your wedding.

14:13.800 --> 14:14.501
Congratulations.

14:14.570 --> 14:15.641
That's right. Congratulations.

14:15.810 --> 14:16.671
Congratulations, Chief.

14:17.641 --> 14:18.840
Yes.

14:21.411 --> 14:22.450
Let's eat.

14:34.460 --> 14:36.230
(Guards are sacred, do not encroach on them)

14:41.930 --> 14:42.730
You look beautiful.

14:43.871 --> 14:45.230
Don't I look the same as usual?

14:49.041 --> 14:50.041
You're still pretty.

14:51.241 --> 14:51.911
Let's go.

14:54.141 --> 14:55.340
Welcome.

14:55.950 --> 14:57.850
You're the chief. Mind your image.

14:59.350 --> 15:00.980
It's not against the rules for me to come, right?

15:02.080 --> 15:02.950
You're a family.

15:03.450 --> 15:04.421
Can't you have this kind of benefit?

15:08.021 --> 15:09.430
Why do you keep looking at me?

15:10.991 --> 15:11.991
The color of your lipstick today...

15:12.430 --> 15:13.430
is different from last time.

15:14.531 --> 15:16.200
It's the one you gave me.

15:17.070 --> 15:18.371
If you don't like it,

15:18.771 --> 15:19.671
I'll return it to you.

15:20.501 --> 15:21.300
How?

15:22.070 --> 15:23.210
How do you want me to return it?

15:26.310 --> 15:27.111
Like that.

16:11.820 --> 16:13.521
Let me formally introduce you.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.090
This is Dr. Xu from the municipal hospital,

16:16.761 --> 16:17.761
your sister-in-law.

16:17.830 --> 16:19.001
- Hello, Sister-in-law! - Hi, Sister-in-law!

16:20.600 --> 16:21.401
Hello, everyone.

16:23.470 --> 16:24.771
Is your sister-in-law pretty?

16:24.871 --> 16:26.271
- Yes! - Yes!

16:29.210 --> 16:30.011
Guys.

16:30.171 --> 16:31.340
She was just Dr. Xu before.

16:31.411 --> 16:32.781
She's our sister-in-law now.

16:32.840 --> 16:33.911
We should let Chief...

16:33.980 --> 16:35.241
give us some tips.

16:35.310 --> 16:36.281
Right?

16:39.121 --> 16:40.180
- Tell us, Chief. - Right.

16:40.450 --> 16:41.521
- Tell us, Chief. - Yes.

16:41.680 --> 16:43.621
Chief, give us some tips.

16:43.690 --> 16:45.121
Yang Chi's courtship with Xiao Xi...

16:45.190 --> 16:46.161
hasn't borne fruit yet.

16:46.220 --> 16:48.261
Why would I tell you if it has borne fruit or not?

16:48.320 --> 16:49.531
Ask Jiang Yi.

16:50.161 --> 16:51.291
Chief and Xu Qin...

16:51.361 --> 16:52.330
were high school classmates.

16:52.401 --> 16:53.460
They're not like you.

16:53.531 --> 16:54.200
You're right.

16:54.261 --> 16:56.401
Chief enjoyed the advantage of being in a favorable position.

16:56.470 --> 16:57.901
He's keeping what's good to himself.

17:00.800 --> 17:01.741
Chief has been plotting this...

17:01.800 --> 17:03.210
for such a long time.

17:03.271 --> 17:04.041
That's right.

17:04.310 --> 17:05.881
Remember the last time we went to the hospital?

17:05.940 --> 17:06.741
That time at the dentist.

17:06.881 --> 17:08.281
I knew something was off.

17:08.340 --> 17:09.151
You didn't believe me.

17:09.550 --> 17:10.781
Now that I think about it,

17:10.850 --> 17:12.051
Chief was really acting strange that day.

17:12.111 --> 17:14.020
It turns out he was reunited with Xu Qin after a long time.

17:14.081 --> 17:16.091
He was plotting something.

17:18.790 --> 17:19.960
Chief.

17:20.361 --> 17:21.720
Have you had your eyes on her since then?

17:23.790 --> 17:24.460
Of course.

17:45.780 --> 17:46.520
Miao Miao.

17:46.921 --> 17:47.980
Stop slacking off.

17:48.051 --> 17:49.690
Come and help me.

17:50.151 --> 17:51.290
Mom, I'm busy.

17:51.921 --> 17:54.121
What are you busy with every day?

17:54.760 --> 17:56.161
My brother is getting married.

17:56.230 --> 17:57.490
They're both so busy.

17:57.561 --> 17:58.661
They don't care about anything.

17:58.730 --> 17:59.530
I have to do these things.

18:00.161 --> 18:02.161
Your brother said it's too hot now.

18:02.230 --> 18:03.131
He wants to wait until fall...

18:03.200 --> 18:04.470
to hold the wedding in October.

18:04.530 --> 18:05.671
What's the rush?

18:06.101 --> 18:07.601
You don't get it.

18:07.671 --> 18:09.470
Many people are getting married in October.

18:09.671 --> 18:10.841
If I don't book a venue now,

18:10.911 --> 18:12.881
where will we get one for the wedding?

18:14.881 --> 18:15.881
You have a point.

18:15.950 --> 18:16.851
That's right.

18:16.950 --> 18:18.510
Besides, after booking the venue,

18:18.581 --> 18:20.180
we have to choose the menu.

18:20.520 --> 18:21.450
After choosing the menu,

18:21.520 --> 18:23.790
the number of guests must be counted too, right?

18:24.220 --> 18:25.891
They're so busy.

18:25.960 --> 18:27.790
I even have to help them try on wedding dresses.

18:28.690 --> 18:29.361
I'm speechless.

18:29.591 --> 18:30.730
I think it's better...

18:30.790 --> 18:32.091
for me to get married myself.

18:32.161 --> 18:33.131
I can get some monetary gifts too.

18:33.801 --> 18:35.000
What are you talking about?

18:35.770 --> 18:36.671
Mom.

18:36.730 --> 18:37.901
A girl needs to be pampered.

18:37.970 --> 18:39.000
Why do you keep hitting me?

18:39.071 --> 18:40.171
Are you a girl?

18:41.270 --> 18:42.040
Ms. Miao.

18:42.101 --> 18:43.010
What you're saying now...

18:43.071 --> 18:44.611
has seriously hurt my mind and body.

18:44.671 --> 18:46.510
All right, let's look at venues.

18:47.141 --> 18:47.811
Look at this.

18:47.881 --> 18:48.540
How many did you pick?

18:48.611 --> 18:50.010
I picked three in total.

18:50.210 --> 18:50.950
Take a look.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.430
What do you think? Do you like it?

19:09.930 --> 19:10.671
I do.

19:10.770 --> 19:11.801
But it's useless for me to like it.

19:11.871 --> 19:12.571
Let's go.

19:12.641 --> 19:13.440
I'll try on the next one.

19:16.871 --> 19:17.911
Look at the fabric.

19:19.881 --> 19:20.710
Not bad.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.551
Do you like it?

19:23.051 --> 19:23.851
I do.

19:24.411 --> 19:26.180
Will you take this one then?

19:26.480 --> 19:27.651
Is there another one?

19:47.171 --> 19:48.470
Here, have some water first.

19:49.970 --> 19:50.740
Thank you.

20:03.891 --> 20:04.551
What do you think?

20:04.621 --> 20:05.591
Do you like any of them?

20:06.561 --> 20:07.220
This one,

20:07.421 --> 20:08.091
this one,

20:08.220 --> 20:08.891
and this one...

20:09.290 --> 20:09.960
are all very nice.

20:11.030 --> 20:12.661
Which one have you decided on then?

20:13.960 --> 20:15.871
After careful selection,

20:16.171 --> 20:18.230
these three have already stood out.

20:18.401 --> 20:20.171
We're just waiting for my sister-in-law to make a decision.

20:20.371 --> 20:21.601
Your sister-in-law?

20:21.970 --> 20:23.440
You're not the bride?

20:25.071 --> 20:26.680
I'm doing the pre-selection for her wedding dress.

20:26.811 --> 20:28.440
We can save time then.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.381
She is the people's doctor.

20:30.450 --> 20:31.851
She saves lives every day.

20:31.911 --> 20:32.651
She's very busy.

20:33.480 --> 20:34.881
I see. All right.

20:35.051 --> 20:36.020
You've already chosen the main wedding dress.

20:36.091 --> 20:37.821
There's also the secondary dress and the toast dress.

20:37.921 --> 20:39.091
Do you still want to continue?

20:40.520 --> 20:41.321
There's more?

21:05.180 --> 21:06.821
(Ma's Crayfish)

21:07.381 --> 21:08.651
How have you been lately?

21:09.180 --> 21:10.821
I heard from Xiao Yi Xiao that you kept sleeping at home...

21:10.891 --> 21:11.921
for a period of time before.

21:13.220 --> 21:14.561
It seems like I've been tired for a long time,

21:16.790 --> 21:17.960
carrying a heavy bag...

21:18.190 --> 21:19.361
while walking for a long time...

21:20.230 --> 21:22.430
and didn't stop or rest.

21:23.700 --> 21:24.571
This happens...

21:24.801 --> 21:26.071
to be an opportunity...

21:26.801 --> 21:27.801
to sleep well for a few days.

21:28.871 --> 21:29.671
I think...

21:30.240 --> 21:32.680
your current condition is much better than before.

21:33.141 --> 21:34.141
You've relaxed a lot.

21:36.051 --> 21:36.710
Relax?

21:38.180 --> 21:39.750
That word doesn't suit me at all.

21:54.361 --> 21:55.401
That's a pretty ring.

22:01.270 --> 22:02.171
This is for you.

22:02.811 --> 22:03.671
What's this?

22:04.111 --> 22:05.111
A wedding gift.

22:06.081 --> 22:07.081
I'm not married yet.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.280
Take it in advance.

22:09.851 --> 22:10.510
Thank you.

22:11.851 --> 22:12.551
By the way,

22:13.980 --> 22:14.881
I'm going to work in Guokun.

22:17.391 --> 22:18.220
Have you made up your mind?

22:19.990 --> 22:21.121
After getting married,

22:21.591 --> 22:23.361
you'll have our family to support you.

22:27.030 --> 22:27.930
Why did you...

22:28.801 --> 22:30.270
suddenly make such a drastic change?

22:33.440 --> 22:34.671
I just feel like...

22:35.200 --> 22:36.371
Mom and Dad are old.

22:37.470 --> 22:38.440
Fighting with them this time...

22:39.710 --> 22:40.881
had hurt them a lot too.

22:53.921 --> 22:54.591
Bye.

22:55.121 --> 22:55.921
Bye.

23:13.111 --> 23:14.010
Yan Chen.

23:14.540 --> 23:16.311
I'm so lucky to have you...

23:16.680 --> 23:17.551
as my family forever.

23:19.111 --> 23:20.081
This kind of luck...

23:20.881 --> 23:22.720
has been mine since the first time I saw you...

23:23.351 --> 23:24.351
when I was little.

24:00.361 --> 24:01.190
Xu Qin,

24:01.260 --> 24:03.490
I've already booked your wedding photoshoot schedule.

24:03.561 --> 24:04.790
I also picked a few wedding dresses for you.

24:04.930 --> 24:05.591
Take a look.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.361
There are three wedding dresses here...

24:09.430 --> 24:10.571
and two gowns.

24:11.301 --> 24:13.000
These are too many.

24:13.571 --> 24:14.770
Not at all.

24:14.841 --> 24:15.970
I want to help you choose...

24:16.040 --> 24:17.470
the perfect package.

24:18.071 --> 24:19.270
I like everything you choose.

24:20.010 --> 24:20.740
These will do.

24:22.081 --> 24:22.750
By the way, Xu Qin,

24:23.151 --> 24:24.480
how many relatives and friends do you have?

24:24.551 --> 24:26.180
I need to book the wedding banquet.

24:29.081 --> 24:29.950
Not many.

24:30.151 --> 24:31.121
Just a few.

24:33.821 --> 24:34.520
It's okay.

24:34.591 --> 24:35.621
We have a big family.

24:35.690 --> 24:37.460
We'll make it look grand for you.

24:37.930 --> 24:38.591
Okay.

24:49.200 --> 24:49.970
What do you think?

24:50.540 --> 24:51.411
- Is it pretty? - Xu Qin.

24:52.470 --> 24:54.010
You're so pretty.

24:55.911 --> 24:56.710
Really?

24:58.450 --> 24:59.950
Song Yan, you're back.

25:01.280 --> 25:02.720
Look, isn't Xu Qin pretty?

25:06.091 --> 25:07.921
I'll leave this to you.

25:08.020 --> 25:08.821
I'll get going.

25:09.020 --> 25:09.960
You've matured.

25:19.901 --> 25:20.801
You're back.

25:25.740 --> 25:26.811
Is it from your brother?

25:29.680 --> 25:30.480
It's so pretty.

25:31.450 --> 25:32.180
Really?

25:39.190 --> 25:40.561
You came at the right time.

25:41.290 --> 25:41.960
Just now,

25:42.020 --> 25:43.730
there were a lot of questions for me...

25:43.831 --> 25:44.760
and you weren't here.

25:45.061 --> 25:45.990
You're here now.

25:46.601 --> 25:47.661
What kind of questions are they?

25:47.730 --> 25:48.401
Ask me again.

25:51.131 --> 25:52.331
Actually, it's nothing.

25:52.401 --> 25:53.200
Just...

25:53.470 --> 25:55.040
choosing the styles for wedding photos...

25:55.200 --> 25:56.510
and picking a venue for the wedding.

26:00.040 --> 26:00.710
Xu Qin.

26:01.710 --> 26:02.510
Do you want...

26:02.740 --> 26:03.911
to hold the wedding at a hotel?

26:07.051 --> 26:07.851
I know.

26:08.351 --> 26:09.891
They're all people you don't know and are not familiar with.

26:10.851 --> 26:11.921
You'll have to keep smiling.

26:11.990 --> 26:13.091
That's not fun, right?

26:16.091 --> 26:17.190
What if we don't hold a wedding?

26:17.430 --> 26:18.361
Let's make it simple.

26:18.561 --> 26:19.631
How can we do that?

26:20.361 --> 26:21.661
There still has to be a sense of ceremony.

26:25.401 --> 26:26.101
Come on.

26:32.641 --> 26:33.740
I think...

26:34.540 --> 26:36.111
we should pick a sunny day...

26:36.881 --> 26:38.010
and do it...

26:38.081 --> 26:39.151
beneath the fire station's flagpole.

26:40.151 --> 26:42.051
We'll neatly place dozens of chairs.

26:42.750 --> 26:44.520
You should gather the people you want.

26:44.651 --> 26:47.190
I will gather all the rascals in my team...

26:47.361 --> 26:48.091
to watch the ceremony.

26:48.290 --> 26:48.990
That will work.

26:50.730 --> 26:52.061
Xiao Meng will be the flower girl.

26:52.430 --> 26:53.661
Jiang Yu can be the emcee.

26:53.760 --> 26:54.561
What do you think?

26:55.061 --> 26:56.530
Xiao Meng is a dog.

26:56.801 --> 26:57.770
Get a human.

26:58.230 --> 26:58.901
All right.

27:06.911 --> 27:07.710
Hello, Mr. Meng.

27:17.591 --> 27:18.250
Everyone.

27:19.020 --> 27:20.091
Starting today,

27:20.621 --> 27:22.220
I'll be managing the Guokun Group.

27:23.131 --> 27:24.331
I look forward to working with you.

27:39.071 --> 27:40.881
(Wedding photoshoot)

27:46.250 --> 27:54.091
(Wedding photoshoot)

28:08.071 --> 28:09.401
Are they not here yet?

28:09.970 --> 28:10.841
It has been so long.

28:10.911 --> 28:12.440
I have another appointment.

28:13.111 --> 28:14.710
They'll be here soon.

28:21.081 --> 28:21.950
How about this?

28:22.020 --> 28:22.680
Let's do it another day.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.950
Let's find another time.

28:25.220 --> 28:26.421
No, I'm begging you.

28:26.490 --> 28:27.720
Please wait a little longer.

28:27.790 --> 28:29.091
My brother is a firefighter.

28:29.161 --> 28:30.230
My sister-in-law is a doctor.

28:30.290 --> 28:31.530
It wasn't easy for them to find the time...

28:31.591 --> 28:32.790
to take wedding photos together.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.361
They've parted and reunited in the past 10 years.

28:34.430 --> 28:35.530
Today, if...

28:35.601 --> 28:36.730
If it doesn't work out,

28:36.970 --> 28:38.571
that would really be the end for them.

28:38.831 --> 28:39.530
I'm begging you.

28:39.601 --> 28:41.000
Please wait.

28:41.671 --> 28:42.341
Then...

28:42.571 --> 28:44.440
Then I'll wait. All right.

28:44.510 --> 28:45.311
Don't be anxious too.

28:46.311 --> 28:47.081
By the way,

28:47.141 --> 28:49.081
you tried on the wedding gown last time, right?

28:49.210 --> 28:50.780
I thought you were the bride.

28:51.680 --> 28:52.851
I'm not the bride.

28:53.121 --> 28:54.121
I'm just an observer.

28:54.180 --> 28:55.151
The people involved aren't anxious,

28:56.180 --> 28:57.551
but I am.

28:57.851 --> 28:58.520
All right.

28:58.591 --> 28:59.421
Don't be anxious too.

28:59.490 --> 29:00.421
Let's wait.

29:08.430 --> 29:09.101
Song Yan.

29:09.161 --> 29:09.871
Here.

29:10.131 --> 29:11.030
Here!

30:21.071 --> 30:22.101
I regret it.

30:31.980 --> 30:33.081
What do you regret?

30:42.990 --> 30:44.960
I regret not being with you sooner.

31:04.611 --> 31:06.551
The Meteorological Department has issued an orange warning.

31:06.750 --> 31:08.480
The sixth typhoon of the year, Narcissus,

31:08.551 --> 31:10.091
is expected to make landfall at nine o'clock tomorrow...

31:10.151 --> 31:11.720
in the southeast area of our city.

31:12.151 --> 31:12.851
Around its center,

31:12.921 --> 31:14.020
the maximum wind will be at level 14.

31:14.220 --> 31:16.760
It's expected to move at 18 to 20km per hour...

31:16.831 --> 31:18.361
towards the northwest.

31:18.530 --> 31:20.161
The intensity will slowly increase.

31:20.401 --> 31:21.730
Due to typhoon Narcissus,

31:21.801 --> 31:23.270
there will be heavy or torrential rain...

31:23.331 --> 31:24.430
in our city.

31:24.571 --> 31:26.030
To prepare for typhoon Narcissus,

31:26.101 --> 31:27.341
several reservoirs...

31:27.401 --> 31:29.671
in Linkou and Yuewan will be opened for prerelease.

31:31.210 --> 31:32.270
We've received an emergency notice...

31:32.341 --> 31:33.240
from the Flood Control Headquarters.

31:33.311 --> 31:34.411
The sixth super typhoon...

31:34.480 --> 31:35.641
is about to make landfall in our city.

31:35.710 --> 31:36.811
I'm now declaring...

31:36.881 --> 31:38.280
that we're on alert level 1.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.921
All personnel must cancel all leaves...

31:39.980 --> 31:41.520
and be on 24-hour standby.

31:41.581 --> 31:43.190
In the next 48 hours...

31:43.250 --> 31:44.651
or even 72 hours,

31:44.720 --> 31:46.960
we will face another big challenge.

31:47.020 --> 31:48.690
I hope all the party members and executives...

31:48.760 --> 31:49.861
can take the lead.

31:49.930 --> 31:51.061
Do you understand?

31:51.131 --> 31:51.831
- Yes! - Yes!

31:52.131 --> 31:53.331
A typhoon is coming.

31:54.000 --> 31:56.730
We are the people's wall that block against the wind...

31:56.801 --> 31:58.230
and port to shelter them from the rain.

31:58.371 --> 32:00.000
This is our duty...

32:00.071 --> 32:01.040
and mission...

32:01.240 --> 32:02.401
as firefighters.

32:02.841 --> 32:03.641
Stand up.

32:04.641 --> 32:05.540
A typhoon is coming.

32:06.111 --> 32:07.341
We must work hard.

32:08.141 --> 32:09.881
We must risk our lives to protect...

32:10.710 --> 32:13.280
the 12 million citizens of Yancheng.

32:13.381 --> 32:16.121
Protect this city.

32:16.351 --> 32:17.790
Are you confident?

32:17.851 --> 32:18.891
- Yes! - Yes!

32:27.361 --> 32:28.700
(China Fire and Rescue)

32:36.371 --> 32:38.270
Son, come and help.

32:39.341 --> 32:40.480
Take this inside.

32:41.280 --> 32:43.250
Dear, get the tape.

32:44.611 --> 32:45.480
Close the window.

32:47.851 --> 32:48.651
Lock it.

32:51.651 --> 32:53.151
Son, get the basin.

33:03.470 --> 33:04.401
Are you done sealing it?

33:05.000 --> 33:05.730
Yes.

33:18.980 --> 33:20.520
This afternoon, the Meteorological Department...

33:20.581 --> 33:22.381
initiated Typhoon Response Level 2.

33:22.651 --> 33:24.321
The typhoon warning level has been raised from orange...

33:24.391 --> 33:26.351
to the highest level, red.

33:26.720 --> 33:27.690
The municipal Emergency Office...

33:27.760 --> 33:28.891
and Flood Control Headquarters...

33:28.960 --> 33:30.361
issued an emergency announcement...

33:30.430 --> 33:32.960
asking staff in all departments...

33:33.030 --> 33:34.331
to remain at their posts...

33:34.401 --> 33:37.200
and for party members to take the lead...

33:37.270 --> 33:38.631
in flood and disaster control.

33:39.000 --> 33:40.040
In this extreme weather,

33:40.101 --> 33:42.171
don't go out unless it's necessary.

33:42.470 --> 33:44.510
Protect yourselves.

33:45.841 --> 33:47.440
Due to typhoon Narcissus,

33:47.510 --> 33:48.841
starting tonight until tomorrow,

33:49.141 --> 33:50.780
the coastal zones and coastlands in our city...

33:50.851 --> 33:52.280
will continue to experience gale force winds...

33:52.351 --> 33:53.581
from Category 7 to Category 10.

33:53.651 --> 33:55.621
It will also be accompanied by a heavy rainstorm.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.851
The Meteorological Department announced a red rainstorm alert.

33:57.921 --> 33:59.520
Citizens are advised to refrain from going out.

33:59.591 --> 34:00.520
Be careful.

34:01.190 --> 34:01.990
Watch out!

34:06.561 --> 34:07.361
Zhang Qiang!

34:07.801 --> 34:08.530
Zhang Qiang.

34:08.801 --> 34:09.760
Are you all right?

34:33.761 --> 34:34.660
Tell the blood bank to prepare blood.

34:34.721 --> 34:35.390
Yes.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.761
Tell Orthopedics to come down for a consultation. Stat.

34:37.830 --> 34:38.491
Yes.

34:39.190 --> 34:40.060
What's the situation?

34:40.330 --> 34:41.361
He was hit by a billboard.

34:41.431 --> 34:42.401
Multiple injuries and excessive blood loss.

34:42.460 --> 34:43.631
We've informed the blood bank to have the blood ready.

34:49.701 --> 34:51.040
His pupils are dilated.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.080
There's nasal leakage and ear leakage.

34:54.140 --> 34:55.440
High-level damage to the skull and brain is suspected.

34:58.951 --> 35:00.080
Metacarpal fracture of the right hand.

35:05.290 --> 35:06.761
Bilateral tib-fib fractures to the lower extremities.

35:06.921 --> 35:07.890
Call the trauma team.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.091
- Prepare for resuscitation. - Got it.

35:09.160 --> 35:10.230
The patient needs a head CT scan.

35:10.290 --> 35:11.060
Push him to the CT room first.

35:11.131 --> 35:11.830
- Okay. - Okay.

35:16.560 --> 35:17.971
(No matter where you go, the colorful Yancheng is the best)

35:22.701 --> 35:24.171
Yang Chi, lower it slowly.

35:24.241 --> 35:25.471
All of you, lower it slowly.

35:29.241 --> 35:30.710
Done. You can lower it now.

35:32.681 --> 35:33.850
Those below, watch carefully.

35:33.921 --> 35:35.051
Hold on tight.

35:41.321 --> 35:42.091
That's right.

35:42.390 --> 35:43.761
Lower it slowly.

35:43.991 --> 35:44.660
Okay.

35:58.910 --> 35:59.611
Are you okay?

36:00.540 --> 36:01.440
Are you all right?

36:03.080 --> 36:03.951
Chief, he's fine.

36:04.011 --> 36:04.810
Keep lowering it.

36:05.551 --> 36:06.881
Keep lowering it.

36:07.721 --> 36:08.781
Dear, look.

36:08.980 --> 36:10.451
It's here on Weibo SuperTalk.

36:10.520 --> 36:12.120
Someone is trapped at 13 Xiafang Road...

36:12.190 --> 36:12.850
He needs urgent help.

36:12.921 --> 36:14.020
(Yancheng rainstorm assistance)

36:14.091 --> 36:15.091
(Someone is trapped at 13 Xiafang Road. Need urgent help.)

36:15.160 --> 36:16.660
(Share)

36:17.230 --> 36:18.131
Look at the rain outside.

36:18.190 --> 36:20.631
My goodness, it's so heavy.

36:28.901 --> 36:29.640
Slow down.

36:45.721 --> 36:46.861
The road is blocked ahead.

36:46.921 --> 36:48.460
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

36:48.520 --> 36:50.160
We don't need a taxi. We don't have money.

36:50.390 --> 36:51.890
I won't charge you.

36:51.960 --> 36:52.991
Get in quickly.

36:53.361 --> 36:54.730
Thank you.

36:57.631 --> 36:58.301
My gosh, how pitiful.

36:58.370 --> 36:59.901
Someone is trapped in the viaduct.

37:00.841 --> 37:01.901
The big tree is blocking the way.

37:01.971 --> 37:03.071
Many people are trapped.

37:33.701 --> 37:34.841
Please stop, sir.

37:43.810 --> 37:44.910
Stop, sir.

37:46.810 --> 37:47.480
He stopped.

37:48.151 --> 37:49.781
Where are you going in this heavy rain?

37:49.850 --> 37:50.921
My wife is not feeling well.

37:50.991 --> 37:51.850
We're going to the hospital.

37:51.921 --> 37:52.951
Get in the car. I'll take you there.

37:53.020 --> 37:54.120
- Okay, thank you. - Thank you.

37:57.160 --> 37:57.830
Come.

37:58.730 --> 37:59.591
Come. Get in.

38:00.131 --> 38:01.330
- Okay, thank you. - Let's go.

38:01.631 --> 38:02.460
Thank you so much.

38:28.790 --> 38:30.091
Miss, did you fall down?

38:30.390 --> 38:31.290
I'm fine, sir.

38:31.991 --> 38:32.660
Thank you.

38:35.031 --> 38:35.960
Your umbrella is broken.

38:36.560 --> 38:37.870
I have a raincoat in my car. I'll get it for you.

38:43.201 --> 38:43.870
Put it on.

38:44.270 --> 38:45.310
Thank you, sir.

38:45.910 --> 38:46.640
Put it on.

38:46.940 --> 38:47.611
Thank you, sir.

38:47.681 --> 38:48.381
You're welcome.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.310
Go home.

38:50.480 --> 38:51.451
Be careful.

39:34.390 --> 39:36.491
Go that way.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.631
The manhole cover is broken.

39:37.730 --> 39:38.631
Go that way.

39:53.540 --> 39:54.310
What's the matter?

40:01.151 --> 40:02.620
The manhole cover is broken.

40:02.681 --> 40:04.151
Drive a little to the right.

40:06.321 --> 40:07.721
Are you just going to stand there?

40:08.190 --> 40:09.591
I just called the city hall.

40:09.790 --> 40:11.091
They're stuck in traffic.

40:11.460 --> 40:13.060
I'll stay a little longer. It's dangerous.

40:15.631 --> 40:16.431
Thank you.

40:16.531 --> 40:17.631
Be careful too.
